<title>UK: World Bank sets 200 million Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 200 million Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.50	MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.65    PAY DATE    28.AUG.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
